=== Rolling stock ===

The line is operated by [[Intercon]]'s high-speed rail fleet, shared with the [[Sant Cristòfor–Areza HSR line|Sant Cristòfor–Areza HSR line]]. Rolling stock is stabled and maintained at the train yard at [[Varakí TDV (CristoCarril)|Varakí TDV]], which serves both the Areza and Portnou HSR fleets.

